    {
        "content": "<p>Otherwise maybe a solution that would remain ergonomic would probably be an environment extension and a special syntax, like <code>term \"?\"</code>, that calls elaborators registered on the extension, so that you don't need to declare new syntax for every single special elaboration annotation similar to this one.</p>",
        "id": 580952896,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1774213114
    },
